OL,3,A'Moonies' church leader jailed for two
OL,4,Ayears over bribery offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the controversial
OL,7,FUnification Church has been sentenced
OL,8,Fto two years in prison for bribing
OL,9,FSouth Korea's former first lady and
OL,10,Fother political funding offences.
OL,12,FA court found that Han Hak-ja's church
OL,13,Fgave Kim Keon Hee, the wife of ousted
OL,14,FPresident Yoon Suk Yeol, two Chanel
OL,15,Fbags and a diamond necklace, together
OL,16,Fworth 80 million won ($57,900;
OL,17,F#42,500).
OL,19,FEarlier this year, Kim was sentenced to
OL,20,F20 months in jail for accepting bribes
OL,21,Ffrom the church.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
