OL,3,A'Moonies' church leader jailed for two
OL,4,Ayears over bribery offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHan, the 83-year-old widow of the
OL,7,FUnification Church's founder Sun Myung
OL,8,FMoon, had repeatedly denied the
OL,9,Fallegations, calling them "false".
